<title>UK: SOCCER-WALES 0 BELGIUM 2 - LATEST.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-WALES 0 BELGIUM 2 - LATEST.</headline>
<dateline>CARDIFF 1997-03-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgium led Wales 2-0 in their World Cup soccer European group 7 qualifier on Saturday.</p>
<p>Scorers: Bertrand Crasson 24, Lorenzo Staelens 44.</p>
